     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Why brands choose soft gels as a supplement format.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Different audiences prefer different delivery formats. Soft Gels are a category-leading choice when your customers want a specific combination of convenience, dosing precision, and ingredient compatibility.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements, low minimums, and no set-up fees, you can quickly build a soft gels-based product line that fits your audience. Below is what to know about manufacturing soft gels for private label: the formulations we offer, the specs available, how we make them, and which health categories benefit most.</p>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207156914,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #c9dbe2; padding: 70px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 14px;\">HOW IT WORKS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 50px; line-height: 1.2;\">Get to market faster with a partner who handles the heavy lifting.</h2>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">01</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">BUILD YOUR PRODUCT LINE</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements with low minimums and no set-up fees. Choose what fits your audience and your timeline.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">02</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">DESIGN YOUR BRAND</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Use your existing logo, customize a new label, or pick from our professional templates. Our in-house design team brings your vision to life.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">03</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">START SELLING FAST</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Launch in as little as 3 to 4 weeks after approving your labels. Every product passes rigorous quality assurance before it ships.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207156915,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">ADVANTAGES</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">What makes soft gels a strong supplement format.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207156916,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Best format for oils and oil-soluble actives</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Soft gels are the gold standard for fish oil, vitamin D, vitamin E, CoQ10, and other oil-based or oil-soluble ingredients. The format protects sensitive actives and delivers them in a single, easy-to-swallow dose.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Sealed integrity, no oxidation</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Soft gels are sealed shut after filling, preventing oxygen exposure that degrades sensitive ingredients. This is especially important for omega-3s and other oils that turn rancid in lesser packaging.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Faster absorption than hard-shell formats</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Soft gel shells dissolve faster than tablets or hard capsules, releasing actives sooner in the digestive process. The right choice when bioavailability and onset speed matter.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207156917,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: white; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">SPECIFICATIONS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">Manufacturing specs available for private label soft gels.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 760px; margin: 22px auto 0;\">The most common questions from brand owners are about sizes, materials, fill capacity, and minimums. Here is the short answer for each.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207156918,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: white; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\"></h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\"></p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">Round, Oval, Oblong</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Shape Options</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Standard round and oval soft gels are easiest to swallow. Custom shapes available for brand differentiation on higher-volume runs.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">Bovine or Fish</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Gelatin Source</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Standard bovine-derived gelatin is most common. Fish-derived gelatin available for kosher or pescatarian positioning. Plant-based softgel alternatives are in development but limited in active compatibility.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">Up to 1500mg fill</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Fill Capacity</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Soft gels accommodate a wide fill range. Standard fish oil and vitamin D soft gels sit around 500-1000mg. Higher fills possible based on shell capacity.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">Low MOQ</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">Minimums & Set-Up</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Low order minimums and no set-up fees. Soft gel runs typically have a slightly higher MOQ than tablets due to encapsulation tooling. Scoped during discovery.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207156919,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_AS_SoftGel.jpg\" alt=\"Soft Gels manufacturing\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">MANUFACTURING</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">How we manufacture soft gels for private label.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">Soft gel encapsulation runs on rotary die machines that form, fill, and seal the capsule in a single pass. Every batch goes through in-process fill weight verification, seam integrity testing, and finished-product testing for identity, purity, potency, and contaminants before release. Drying and tumbling happen on-site, so your private label soft gels ship customer-ready.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207156920,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #c9dbe2; padding: 50px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Want to see soft gels samples or talk through your formulation?</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #012638; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Request Samples</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
